-# Rangi. One controller action, two screens: the teacher's editable ladder
-# (#/t/ranks, 30-lists.js:25-29) and the student's progress through it
-# (#/s/ranks, 30-sp.js:21-24).
-#
-# The persona comes from MEMBERSHIP, resolved in the controller through the
-# same Redesign::GroupChrome the navigation uses — so this page and the deck
-# beside it can never disagree about who you are here.
- content_for :title, 'Rangi'

- if @ladder.membership
  = render 'student_ladder', ladder: @ladder
- else
  = render 'teacher_ladder', ladder: @ladder
